	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi omnia, quae nuper per fratrem misisti, et ago <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>pietati tuae summa gratias.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Meliten interea amissam au<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>dimus, non certo tamen rumore; sic vigilant principes christiani, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>dum vim suam in propria potius viscera convertant <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quam in communes istos christiani nominis hostes; merito ergo fla<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>gellum hoc dei patiuntur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quod res nostras attinet, in<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>telliges omnia ex his duobus, qui illuc ad conventum mittuntur, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>qui propter monetam institutus est.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p3494">Nicolaus a Diesbach</persName> prorsus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>est partium <placeName>Gallicarum</placeName>, ut sic dicam; inclinat enim illuc <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>totis viribus, ut foedus illud recipiatur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Illum gaudeo hac <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>occasione tibi in manus dari, ut hac de re cum ipso conferas<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>; spero enim tua authoritate, quam plurimi facit, fieri posse, ut in viam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>reducatur et intelligat, quę mala inde secutura sint.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Alter, <persName ref="p8449">Samuel Telamonius</persName>, integer est nec potuit hactenus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>a proposito ullis persuasionibus aut ulla authoritate <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>reliquorum dimoveri.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Commendo illos tibi, ita tamen <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ne resciscant a me tibi quicquam significatum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Sonst stat <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>die sach also, das man noch eir antwort wartet vom künig, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>und vernimpt man (doch weiß ich nitt, ob imm also ist), <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>die antwort sölle verhanden sin, und nemme der künig <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>alle artickel an, wie si imm fürgschriben; doch welle der <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>von <persName>Orbais</persName>, der legat zuͦ <placeName ref="l760">Soloturn</placeName>, die antwort nitt von <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>imm geben, bis die Eidgnoßen wider heim sigind, die hinyn gri<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tten sind gen bsiglen; <foreign xml:lang="la">horum aliqui reversi hac nocte hic pernoctarunt</foreign><note type="margin">Zusatz a.R.: "horum-"</note>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Interea omnes clamitant <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>legatum illum esse proditorem et nescio quę alia.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Confunduntur <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ita intra se ipsos et vident sibi verba dari; non possunt tamen sibi cavere et nescio <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>qua spe fruuntur et sibi magna pollicentur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Qua utinam spe <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>frustrentur!</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quod <placeName ref="l167">Genevenses</placeName> attinet, de quibus his <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>diebus ad fratrem scripsi, sopitum est tantisper negotium, <foreign xml:lang="de">das <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>es zum rechten kumpt.</foreign></s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Burgerneister <persName>Kruͦg</persName> zuͦ <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>sol obman sin.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Nolim etiam, ut isti intelligant me de <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>hoc quicquam vobis significasse; audietis ab ipsis, quomodo omne negotium <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>habeat.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Gaudeo nobis tandem <persName>Danielem</persName> tuum dari <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>et simul <persName>Epitomen</persName> istam, cuius apparatum memini <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>me aliquando apud te vidisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Oro dominum, ut te nobis <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>diutissime servet incolumem, quo diu possis novos <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>subinde laborum tuorum fructus habere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te <persName ref="p8063">Stei<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>gerus</persName> noster, <placeName>Amadiensis</placeName>, socer, <persName ref="p8416">Musculus</persName>, mater, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>uxor, amici denique et fratres omnes.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem dic omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>tuis meo nomine.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 13. augusti 1565.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/><persName ref="p8018">Joh[annes] Hallerus</persName>, tuus <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>perpetuo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrych<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>o Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, domino meo honorando et com<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>patri charissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Auf d. Seite d. Adresse von späterer Hand (17. Jahrhundert.) die Bemerkung:]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">Allerley schryben und <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Messiven an M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrichen Bul<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>lingern</persName> seligen gethan.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
